  "category": "term",
  "note": "Oath 'Lady' (Our Lady) changed to 'Lord'.",
  "replacement": "HOSTESS. No, by my word, not for long. We can't lodge and feed a dozen or fourteen gentlewomen who make an honest living with the prick of their needles without people at once thinking we run a brothel. [_Nym and Pistol draw._] Oh, alas, Our Lady, if he isn't drawing his sword now! We'll see deliberate adultery and murder committed."
